{"title":"2022 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/c/93c5d2b06a9ed105b1a949a8ec83fc5cd8f32329.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x + y}{2} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"81\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/3/a63f3f91463d70ff7d359559615d27012ddddc6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x - y}{2} = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"81\" height=\"37\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/0/4c03e9132d0b8523781054822b13176d1139d0a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} - y^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"59\" height=\"20\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Adding the two equations, we see:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/1/631adf2542649c7841978f8f26c90da910eb5851.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x + y + x - y}{2} = 5 + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"177\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/d/62d1e7375e601943b3bb958a24e41da8920d601a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 7$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Plugging this into the first equation, we see:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/3/643f7805f3b89ae48cc03cdaef7e644c471b4b38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{y + 7}{2} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"80\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/7/b57c926f0014a62169057026ab794235c050c4f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y + 7 = 5 \\times 2 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"150\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/3/4536ec88bf44d93d74f34d1a1d33ec37f9ee34f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 10 - 7 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"118\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Plugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/d/62d1e7375e601943b3bb958a24e41da8920d601a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 7$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/8/6389a3877e2c9d09826aa0c5e5aa564d8c355afa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/0/4c03e9132d0b8523781054822b13176d1139d0a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} - y^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"59\" height=\"20\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/5/8b5ac1e81bc1172c6e4c683acbe3a6d8121323e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^{2} - 3^{2} = 49 - 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"131\" height=\"18\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/f/1bf6236d6ffe2b128eeec93f338f998ff79d17d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Multiplying_Equations.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Multiplying_Equations)\">Solution 2 (Multiplying Equations)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Multiplying Equations)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiplying the two equations together, we see:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/c/1fc71660ab8e2b78200e9abe25d6eb73916ffd8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(x + y)(x - y)}{2 \\times 2} = 5 \\times 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"183\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p>Using <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Difference_of_squares\" title=\"Difference of squares\">difference of squares</a>, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/3/45343e53f51e3fffc04df02ff5735b8b5c4b5af5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x^{2} - y^{2}}{4} = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"105\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/0/5107044c28f80cff645cfead449566c81f637cd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} - y^{2} = 10 \\times 4 = \\boxed{40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"186\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC\" title=\"2022 CSMC\">2022 CSMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CSMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CSMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2022 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part A Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2022 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Senior_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Senior Competition\">CEMC Senior Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018064319\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 137/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1283/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 134/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2989/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.923      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n100.00%    7.923      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37421:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018064319 and revision id 289246. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}